         <title>CCDASTRO Workflow Manager 1.1.39</title>
         <description>
            <p>Configurable PixInsight post-processing workflow manager.</p>
            <ul>
               <li>v1.1.39 runs BlurXTerminator without a workspace icon by default, using explicit Correct Only settings</li>
               <li>Workflow controls offer adjustable star/nonstellar sharpening and halo adjustment; Automatic PSF is enabled</li>
               <li>An explicit optional CCDASTRO_BlurX icon override preserves all saved process settings</li>
               <li>BlurX settings are remembered; README and website instructions updated</li>
            </ul>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
